That they've stopped making out so that they can weigh in.
他们停下亲热，就是为了能插上一脚。

1030
00:42:43.020 --> 00:42:44.320
And they're for a fight.
他们支持打架。

1031
00:42:44.500 --> 00:42:45.440
They're like, do it.
他们说，动手啊。

1032
00:42:45.660 --> 00:42:46.160
Hit him.
打他。

1033
00:42:46.420 --> 00:42:46.860
Hit him.
打他。

1034
