00:43:00.400 --> 00:43:02.960
I love that Dwight said, I've framed many animals.
我太喜欢德怀特说的那句“我栽赃过很多动物”了。

1041
00:43:04.300 --> 00:43:06.920
I framed a raccoon opening a Christmas gift.
我曾栽赃过一只浣熊拆开圣诞礼物。

1042
00:43:07.760 --> 00:43:08.820
Oh, Dwight.
哦，德怀特。

1043
00:43:09.460 --> 00:43:14.940
Well, Michael thinks it sounds mean, but sometimes the end justifies the mean.
嗯，迈克尔觉得这听起来很刻薄，但有时为了目的可以不择手段。

1044
00:43:15.220 --> 00:43:16.400
That's such a good line.
那句台词真棒。

1045
00:43:16.620 --> 00:43:17.640
It's such a good line.
那句台词真棒。

1046
00:43:17.740 --> 00:43:18.920
It's so smart.
太聪明了。

1047
00:43:19.140 --> 00:43:20.320
It's smart money.
这很精明。

1048
