That's how detailed Phil Shea was.
这就是菲尔·谢伊工作有多细致。

1075
00:44:25.860 --> 00:44:26.000
Yep.
没错。

1076
00:44:26.200 --> 00:44:29.500
If you had a prop wallet, it reflected your character.
如果你有一个道具钱包，它会反映出你的角色特征。

1077
00:44:29.960 --> 00:44:33.360
Although, is Michael going to the library and why?
不过，迈克尔会去图书馆吗？为什么？

1078
00:44:33.360 --> 00:44:34.300
What's that for?
那是用来干嘛的？

1079
00:44:34.800 --> 00:44:40.300
I mean, I feel like Michael's probably had that library card for like 20 years in his wallet.
我是说，我觉得迈克尔钱包里那张借书证可能放了有20年了。

1080
00:44:40.880 --> 00:44:41.060
Yeah.
是啊。

1081
00:44:41.480 --> 00:44:44.760
Maybe there was a time where he didn't have internet and he'd have to go to the library.
也许曾经有一段时间他没有网络，不得不去图书馆。

1082
00:44:45.020 --> 00:44:45.540
Oh, wait.
哦，等等。

1083
00:44:45.600 --> 00:44:46.480
We didn't have internet.
我们那时候没有网络。

1084
