Yeah, Pam comes clean, and I remember shooting this because Pam kind of goes on to take charge
没错，帕姆坦白了，我记得拍这一段的时候，帕姆开始掌控全场。

1183
00:49:21.980 --> 00:49:22.620
of the room.
掌控整个办公室。

1184
00:49:22.860 --> 00:49:28.840
After she admits that she wrote the note, she's like, and I guess I just have to say, what's
在她承认是她写的便条后，她说，我想我不得不说，这张便条有什么问题吗？

1185
