but I remember, Jenna, watching you, and you were so good in this moment because everyone
你知道，我上一次有这样的戏份还是在《海滩游戏》那一集，当时帕姆要向大家倾诉她的感受，抱怨他们没去参加她的艺术展。

1196
00:50:02.600 --> 00:50:04.580
is throwing you little curveballs.
没错。

1197
00:50:04.920 --> 00:50:08.760
Oscar and Stanley and Kevin, they're all kind of sassing you.
那是帕姆的演讲台。

1198
00:50:08.760 --> 00:50:14.200
And, you know, the last time that I had a scene like this was back in Beach Games when
这是帕姆的演讲台，伙计们，作为演员，当我们有机会掌控整个办公区时，这既令人兴奋，又让我们感到有点害怕。

1199
00:50:14.200 --> 00:50:18.640
Pam was going to confront the whole group about her feelings and how they didn't come
哦，确实。

1200
00:50:18.640 --> 00:50:19.460
to her art show.
因为你要掌控整场戏的节奏。

1201
